49:## 3. How we prove it works (before showing FE)
50:
51:1. **Fresh-AI test:** a new AI session that has only the `handoff/` folder and the prompt "Build the Sign-in
52:   screen in React Native" — no other context. We record every question it asks.
53:   - Pass: zero questions already answered in `DECIDED.md`; any question it asks is in `OPEN.md`.
54:   - Its code uses only `tokens.*` and `messages.*` — no typed colours, sizes or words.
55:2. **Person test:** Apurva shows the kit to one FE engineer (30 min) and asks what is still unclear. Their doubts
56:   become fixes to the kit, not one-off answers.
