The rulings move the listed Sign-in questions to DECIDED, and the contract exempts three version-A states from built-element checks. I also found legacy tests that read app code. I’ll retain their IDs and kit checks while removing those reads to respect this task’s boundary.

Node can check state coverage and element records, but picture-to-element completeness still needs visual review without access to the app or a browser. I’ll document that limit.
